Package: Hypatia
Title: Single-Cell Isoform Analysis
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Timothy", "Pan", , "timothy.pan@northwestern.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Comparative analysis of transcript isoforms in long-read
    single-cell RNA-sequencing data using SingleCellExperiment objects.
    Provides differential isoform usage, diversity, and expression analyses,
    together with count normalization, quality control, summary statistics,
    and visualization across cell populations.
